    "title": "#Breaking | ED Raids 14 Locations Linked to Chhangur Baba | Uttar Pradesh News | India | News18",
    "text": "#Breaking | ED Raids 14 Locations Linked to Chhangur Baba | Uttar Pradesh News | India | News18\n| In a major development, the Enforcement Directorate (ED) has carried out raids at 14 different locations in connection with the high-profile Chhangur Baba case. This crackdown is part of an ongoing investigation into alleged money laundering and financial irregularities linked to the controversial self-styled godman.Sources have confirmed to CNN-News18's Manoj Kumar Gupta that the ED's action is based on financial trails unearthed during preliminary inquiries. These locations are believed to be tied to Chhangur Baba’s network of associates, followers, and shell operations. Mobile App - https://onelink.to/desc-youtube\nGet",
